### 게시글 생성
POST localhost:8080/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "제목",
    "content": "내용",
    "createdBy": "사용자"
}

### 게시글 상세 조회
GET localhost:8080/posts/1

### 게시글 목록조회
GET localhost:8080/posts?page=0&size=10&title=title&createdBy=shnhs

### 게시글 수정
PUT localhost:8080/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "제목",
    "content": "내용",
    "updatedBy": "사용자"
}

### 게시글 삭제
DELETE localhost:8080/posts/1?createdBy=shnhs
